---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Manifesto | Practical Humanism">
	<article class="manifesto-container">
		<header class="manifesto-header reveal">
			<h1>Manifesto</h1>
		</header>
		
		<blockquote class="manifesto-quote reveal">
			"Man is a transitional being, he is not final; for in him and high beyond him ascend the radiant degrees which climb to a divine supermanhood." 
			<cite>— Sri Aurobindo</cite>
		</blockquote>

		<div class="manifesto-text">
			<p class="emphasized reveal">
				I stand where the Ageless Wisdom intersects<br />
				with the exactitudes of modern logic.
			</p>
			
			<p class="reveal">
				What I term <strong>Practical Humanism</strong> is a definite,<br />
				pragmatic Method for the deliberate unfolding<br />
				of human potential.
			</p>
			
			<p class="reveal">
				I recognize that the present human form is not<br />
				an ultimate completion, but an intermediate stage.
			</p>

			<div class="sigil-separator reveal">
				<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<!-- Skull Top -->
					<path d="M12 2C7.58 2 4 5.58 4 10C4 12.5 5.2 14.7 7 16V20C7 21.1 7.9 22 9 22H15C16.1 22 17 21.1 17 20V16C18.8 14.7 20 12.5 20 10C20 5.58 16.42 2 12 2Z" />
					<!-- Eyes -->
					<circle cx="8.5" cy="10.5" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" />
					<circle cx="15.5" cy="10.5" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" />
					<!-- Nose -->
					<path d="M12 13L11 15H13L12 13Z" fill="currentColor" />
					<!-- Jaw Lines -->
					<path d="M10 18H14" />
					<path d="M9 22V20" />
					<path d="M15 22V20" />
				</svg>
			</div>

			<p class="middle-statement reveal">
				I cast aside nothing of the ancient tools;<br />
				rather, I adapt them to present necessities.
			</p>

			<p class="reveal">
				By applying these traditional instruments with a strictly<br />
				practical, testing attitude, I aim to awaken the<br />
				dormant centers of the personality.
			</p>

			<div class="sigil-separator reveal">
				<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<!-- Skull Top -->
					<path d="M12 2C7.58 2 4 5.58 4 10C4 12.5 5.2 14.7 7 16V20C7 21.1 7.9 22 9 22H15C16.1 22 17 21.1 17 20V16C18.8 14.7 20 12.5 20 10C20 5.58 16.42 2 12 2Z" />
					<!-- Eyes -->
					<circle cx="8.5" cy="10.5" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" />
					<circle cx="15.5" cy="10.5" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" />
					<!-- Nose -->
					<path d="M12 13L11 15H13L12 13Z" fill="currentColor" />
					<!-- Jaw Lines -->
					<path d="M10 18H14" />
					<path d="M9 22V20" />
					<path d="M15 22V20" />
				</svg>
			</div>

			<p class="closing reveal">
				The ultimate aim is to make of my own vehicle<br />
				a living laboratory of evolution.
			</p>
			
			<p class="closing-details reveal">
				The Work demands the balanced development of the entire being:<br />
				the purification of the mind, the direction of the Will,<br />
				and the conscious realization of the Indwelling Spirit.
			</p>
		</div>

		<footer class="reveal">
			<hr />
		</footer>
	</article>

	<script>
		const observerOptions = {
			threshold: 0.1
		};

		const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
			entries.forEach(entry => {
				if (entry.isIntersecting) {
					entry.target.classList.add('active');
				}
			});
		}, observerOptions);

		document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
	</script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.manifesto-container {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 4rem 2rem;
	}
	.manifesto-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 6rem;
	}
	.manifesto-header h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 3.5rem);
		letter-spacing: 0.4em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--text-color);
		margin: 0;
		margin-right: -0.4em; /* Compensate for letter-spacing on the last character */
		font-weight: 300;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	.manifesto-quote {
		margin: 0 0 6rem 0;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-style: italic;
		color: var(--accent-muted);
		text-align: center;
		border: none;
		padding: 0;
		opacity: 0.8;
	}
	.manifesto-quote cite {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 2rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-style: normal;
		letter-spacing: 0.3em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		opacity: 0.6;
	}
	.manifesto-text {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--text-color);
		text-align: center;
	}
	.manifesto-text p {
		margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
		opacity: 0.85;
		transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
	}
	.manifesto-text p strong {
		color: var(--text-color);
		opacity: 1;
	}
	.emphasized {
		font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
		font-size: 2rem;
		line-height: 1.4;
		color: var(--accent-color) !important;
		opacity: 1 !important;
	}
	.middle-statement {
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		color: var(--text-color);
	}
	.sigil-separator {
		margin: 6rem 0;
		color: var(--accent-color);
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		opacity: 0.7;
	}
	.closing {
		font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
		font-size: 2rem;
		line-height: 1.4;
		color: var(--accent-color) !important;
		opacity: 1 !important;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;
	}
	.closing-details {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		opacity: 0.8;
		line-height: 2;
	}
	footer hr {
		margin-top: 8rem;
		opacity: 0.1;
	}

	/* Reveal Animation */
	.reveal {
		opacity: 0;
		transform: translateY(20px);
		transition: all 1s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
	}
	.reveal.active {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateY(0);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.manifesto-container {
			padding: 2rem 1rem;
		}
		.manifesto-header h1 {
			font-size: 2rem;
			letter-spacing: 0.2em;
			margin-right: -0.2em;
		}
		.manifesto-quote {
			font-size: 1.1rem;
		}
		.manifesto-text {
			font-size: 1.1rem;
		}
		.emphasized, .closing {
			font-size: 1.6rem;
		}
		.middle-statement {
			font-size: 1.3rem;
		}
	}
</style>
